the move move with a col, a row, a thing and a second thing is legal at a time if
    the col cell the row with knight at the time
    and the col knightMove the row with the thing with the second thing.

the goal of knight is a number at a time if
    a count value is a movecount at the time
    and the scoremap of the count value is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a col cell a row with knight at the time
    and the col cell the row with hole at the time.

when the move move with a col, a row, a thing and a second thing is made
then the col cell the row with hole.

when the move move with a col, a row, a thing and a second thing is made
    and the col cell the row with knight
then the thing cell the second thing with knight
    and it is not the case that the col cell the row with knight.

when the move move with a col, a row, a thing and a second thing is made
    and a count value is a movecount
    and 1 add count with the count value with a third thing
then the third thing is a movecount
    and it is not the case that the count value is a movecount.

it must not be true that
    the move move with a col, a row, a thing and a second thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the col, the row, the thing and the second thing is legal.

initially 0 is a movecount
    and 1 cell 1 with knight
    and knight is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - control(knight)
%   - movecount(3)
%   - cell(1,1,hole)
%   - cell(1,5,hole)
%   - cell(2,3,hole)
%   - cell(2,3,knight)
scenario play is:
    the move move with 1, 1, 2 and 3 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move move with 2, 3, 1 and 5 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move move with 1, 5, 2 and 3 is made from 3 to 4.

